  "version": "3.0.0",
  "description": "A punk zine off a two-drum risograph: torn, taped scraps pasted crooked with hard riso-blue shadows, ransom-note names from eight typefaces, typewriter text, a masking-tape hover bar, a highlighter that swipes under the pointer, rubber stamps, scissor-cut icons and paper sounds. Light only.",
